<item>
<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-25T08:56:13.968Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli air strikes have continued to target senior Hamas security officials in Gaza, killing at least two named figures, while Israel has redirected $90 million from border community recovery budgets to defense and detained a Polish lawmaker ahead of a West Bank visit. Gaza health officials have warned of a rising meningitis epidemic and a night of arson has been linked to Israeli Jewish terrorism, and Israel's top court described West Bank settlers as acting like militias. Israeli minister Ben-Gvir has been accused of seeking a religious war over mosque raids, and Israel has pledged to advance delayed sewage repairs in Gaza under international pressure. The conflict produced 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6rrg7ggq190o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261125-amnesty-calls-for-icc-genocide-probe-over-israel-s-impact-on-births-in-gaza&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/nov/24/myanmar-found-guilty-genocide-should-israel-be-worried-podcast&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168862&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPay0yd3Uza29STzRjVUJyMkdYQ21jRUY4SjA1MnZ4cGExdkNGeEEya2RoY0dkbDNlZV9iSzVOQlpoLUxyWFFxUjRINWt5dnd3NTZpR0YySURVZWhmOWtDeVU5WlNuZFdPYzNzdko0X0ZTbjFySEl5eXhjSkZrUlVZdWpFaHpKX0RLNUpUSzNJcnFob1BNWFNGeko5UzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;